    "description": "Infirmary, level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. Over budget: 448 blocks vs 285 (first build 379 vs 235). White plaster ward in a dark oak frame under a spruce gable roof: six beds (three on each side, heads to the wall, a window over each), bedside tables, a hearth, herb barrels and shelves, a lean-to herb store; L2 adds the brewing stand and cauldron, candles, lanterns, flower boxes, a door canopy and the banner; L3 a herb garden, herb pots, more banners, a bench and a lantern post. Not yet builder-tested: allium, brewing_stand, brick_stairs, candle, cauldron, cornflower, white_wall_banner. Decoration step adds: banner_pattern, item, potted_plant.",
